    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] moves up to its Speed, Fly Speed, or Swim Speed without provoking &amp;Reference[OpportunityAttacks].</p><p class=\"feature\">Each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=6LnRjVsoOrDcYSqw]] within [[lookup @target.template.size activity=6LnRjVsoOrDcYSqw]] [[lookup @target.template.units activity=6LnRjVsoOrDcYSqw]]. of the [[lookup @name lowercase]] as it moves is targeted once by the following effect. <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=6LnRjVsoOrDcYSqw]].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure or Success:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.</p>",
